{"item":{"key":"moment:1000573","id":"1000573","kind":"moment","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"c782182a37eb4562669ac9f0"},"time":1610553600000,"text":"当时拿到这首歌的时候就被伴奏震到，特别是副歌部分的弦乐，有种特别棒的感染力，超级喜欢。后来才知道是赫老师写的，YYDS！！[emot=acfun,1882/][emot=acfun,1882/]//[at uid=237473]@赫勒威尔[/at]：呃，从音频上来说，这个才是无损高音质版本。[emot=acfun,1678/]找人混分轨，可是最便宜的都要两千，[emot=acfun,1714/]还要等半个月，最后一咬牙自己做了。[emot=acfun,1714/]虽然水平渣技术有限，不过仍旧比演唱会版本清晰了很多很多。[emot=acfun,1717/]而且把本是用来道题旋律的闹心的钢琴主旋律去掉了。[emot=acfun,1740/]如果真喜欢这首歌，来听水姐版吧。[emot=acfun,1736/]评论区里抽两个包子头。截止时间31号[emot=acfun,1882/][emot=acfun,1882/]","title":"","images":[],"cover":"","duration":"","views":0,"counts":{"commentCount":4,"likeCount":64,"bananaCount":68,"shareCount":0},"url":"https://m.acfun.cn/communityCircle/moment/1000573","timePrecision":"day","source":{"key":"video:21989123","id":"21989123","kind":"video","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"c782182a37eb4562669ac9f0"},"time":1610603331004,"text":"","title":"【演唱会单品】Shining for You（听过的DD都哭了）","images":[],"cover":"c02a67e1bd62b6acdf208ec2","duration":"03:09","views":76994,"counts":{"commentCount":489,"likeCount":4928,"bananaCount":25512,"shareCount":130},"url":"https://www.acfun.cn/v/ac21989123"},"commentsPending":false,"archivedComments":3,"archivedRoots":3,"threads":{},"commentPages":["comments/1000573/all/1.json"],"hotPages":[],"hotCount":0},"media":{"c02a67e1bd62b6acdf208ec2":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/o_1ervl6ucio0ocgl10sj1j5c4a0.png?imageMogr2/auto-orient/format/webp/quality/80!/ignore-error/1","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/kimg/bs2/zt-image-host/ChYwOGY0YzVhZTBhMTBhOWIxYTZhOTA0EIvK1y8.jpg","https://ali-imgs.acfun.cn/kimg/bs2/zt-image-host/ChYwOGY0YzVhZTBhMTBhOWIxYTZhOTA0EIvK1y8.jpg"]},"c782182a37eb4562669ac9f0":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/newUpload/179922_d1f3e455380346a0bdd3ebec5b12996f.png?imageMogr2/auto-orient/format/webp/quality/80!/ignore-error/1","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/kimg/EKvK1y8qOwoFYWN